<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif" style=""><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;</span></font></span><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif" style="">{!Account.Name}<span style="font-size: 12pt;">,</span></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-US" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">&nbsp;</font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 15.6933px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif" style="">We are pleased to inform you that your Al Naseem Community property purchase with Modon is almost complete. As a valued customer, we are preparing your Sales &amp; Purchase Agreement (SPA), and we would like to invite you to our Sales center to finalise the process in preparation for signing your documents.</font></span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-US" style=""><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif" style="">ate: 11<sup style="">th</sup> – 15<sup style="">th</sup> June 2024&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-US"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">Time: From 9am – 7pm <o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-US"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">Venue: Modon Sales Centre, Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi
<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-US"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: arial;"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif" style=""><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">This </span>is an exciting step towards securing your new
home, and our team will be on hand to assist you through the process and answer
any questions you might have.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></font></span><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif" style=""><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">If you are travelling between 11</span><sup style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">th</sup><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;and 15</span><sup style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">th</sup><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;June, please contact us to arrange an alternative appointment.</span></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-US"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-US"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">During your visit, the following steps will need to be
completed to issue your SPA: <o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"></p><ol style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><li><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal;">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt;">Confirmation of your selected
finishing colour scheme</span></li><li><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt;">Provision of a cheque for the 2% Abu Dhabi Municipality Fees; a bank
transfer can also be accepted for this transaction (see bank details below)</span></li><li><span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal;">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt;">Provision of post-dated checks
for the payments due from September 2024, as per the project payment plan</span></li></ol><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-US"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">Upon completing the steps above, your SPA will be
issued for signature, after which your property will be registered with the Abu
Dhabi Municipality. <o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-US"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">&nbsp;</font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-US"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">To ensure a smooth experience during your visit, please
bring the following documents:</font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"></p><ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><li><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 12pt;">A valid passport copy and Emirates ID (UAE residents
only)</span></li><li><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 12pt;">Any outstanding documents related to your purchase.</span></li><li><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 12pt;">Cheque book.</span></li></ul><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-US"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">We look forward to welcoming you to our Sales Centre
and assisting you in making your new home a reality.</font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-US"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif"><br></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-US"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">Kind regards,</font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-US"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif"><br></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-US"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-US"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">Modon Sales Team</font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-US"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif"><br></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-US"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif"><br></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-US"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">Please note that ADM fee payments can be made by bank transfer:<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-US"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">Account number:</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">4031005972963002</span><br><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">IBAN Number:&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">AE610354031005972963002</span><br><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">Currency:&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">AED</span><br><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">Customer name:&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">HUDAYRIYAT DEVELOPMENT LLC – ADM</span><br><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">Customer address:</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi</span><br><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">Bank name:</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">First Abu Dhabi Bank</span><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-US"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">Swift Code:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;NBADAEAA</font></span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
